WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
If a sudden hazard appears, use the reference emergency-stop signal. Begin with hands

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
clasped above your head, then extend your arms down and outward repeatedly. Stop

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
the maneuver, report the hazard and follow the site's emergency procedures.

